    "show_share": true,
    "description": "We are deeply saddened by the passing of our dear friend and colleague, Professor Emeritus Joe Lugalla, former Dean of Aga Khan University's Institute for Educational Development, East Africa (IED, EA). Professor Lugalla passed away peacefully on July 25, 2023 after battling a long and serious illness. His contributions to AKU were immeasurable, and he will be missed greatly.",
